Native DLLs dropped here are embedded into the single-file build and unpacked at runtime
by Core/NativeAssets.cs. Expected contents:

  playfair.dll      built by native/build-playfair.ps1
  avcodec-*.dll     from an FFmpeg 9.0 shared build
  avutil-*.dll
  swscale-*.dll
  swresample-*.dll

Populated by tools/pack.ps1. Not checked into git - see .gitignore.
